  "body_html": "<p>Discover the perfect personalized gift for the baseball enthusiast in your life with this cozy custom baseball blanket from Jeminise. Ideal for commemorating special moments or simply adding a touch of sports spirit to any space, this blanket offers warmth and a unique personalized touch.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features custom name and number options, making each blanket unique and cherished for baseball players and fans.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in four convenient sizes: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to suit various needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An excellent present for men and women, moms, dads, and perfect for occasions like Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Made from Sherpa and Fleece Fabric, utilizing two layers of polyester for a super soft, lightweight, and comfortable feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Showcases a vibrant Baseball Design, perfect for sports lovers and adding a themed accent to your home.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Design 02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
